/**
 * MCP Connections settings section (Phases 3–5 of mcp-settings-ui-plan).
 *
 * Renders the user-facing surface for configuring, validating, testing,
 * and sample-invoking remote MCP connections. The component owns its
 * own state (form draft + per-connection statuses) and persists user
 * settings via the `user-settings.ts` data layer; it never touches the
 * agent loop directly.
 *
 * After save / delete, it calls `chat-context.refreshAgent()` so the
 * next message picks up the merged effective MCP config.
 */

